    "active": false,
    "hiddenFieldQueryKey": "html_1",
    "html": "<style>\n.sf-outer{font-family:Inter,Poppins;width:100%;max-width:100%;margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}\n.sf-head{background:#1a1a1a;color:#fff;padding:12px 18px;font-size:15px;font-weight:700;border-radius:8px 8px 0 0;margin-top:16px;margin-bottom:0}\n.sf-scroll{border:1px solid #ddd;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 8px 8px;background:#f9f9f9;max-height:260px;overflow-y:auto;padding:16px 18px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.8;color:#444;margin-bottom:0}\n.sf-scroll ol{padding-left:20px}.sf-scroll li{margin-bottom:8px}\n.sf-policies{border:1px solid #ddd;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 8px 8px;padding:20px;background:#fff;margin-bottom:0}\n.sf-p{border-left:4px solid #2643ff;background:#f5f7ff;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;padding:14px 16px;margin-bottom:12px}\n.sf-pl{font-size:13px;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.5px;color:#000;margin-bottom:6px}\n.sf-pt{font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;color:#555}\n.sf-init{border:2px solid #2643ff;border-radius:8px;background:#f0f3ff;padding:20px;margin-top:20px}\n.sf-init p{font-size:13px;color:#444;line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:8px}\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"sf-outer\">\n\n  <!-- SECTION 3: LIABILITY WAIVER -->\n  <div class=\"sf-head\">Liability Waiver &amp; Release — Read Carefully Before Signing</div>\n  <div class=\"sf-scroll\">\n    <p>In consideration of being permitted to participate in any way in the <strong>Martial Arts &amp; Fitness Program, Hip Hop, Cheer, and/or Dance</strong> indicated below and/or being permitted to enter for any purpose any restricted area, the parent(s) and/or legal guardian(s) of the minor participant named below agree:</p>\n    <ol>\n      <li>The parent(s) and/or legal guardian(s) will instruct the minor participant to inspect the facilities and equipment before participating. If anything is believed to be <strong>UNSAFE</strong>, the participant should immediately advise officials and <strong>REFUSE TO PARTICIPATE</strong>. I understand and agree that if at any time I feel anything to be unsafe, I will immediately take all precautions to avoid the unsafe area and refuse to participate further.</li>\n      <li>I/We fully understand and acknowledge that: (a) There are risks and dangers associated with participation in martial arts, hip hop, cheer, and/or dance which could result in bodily injury, partial and/or total disability, paralysis and death; (b) The social and economic losses and/or damages could be severe; (c) These risks may be caused by the action, inaction or negligence of the participant or others, including the Releasees; (d) There may be other risks not known to us or not reasonably foreseeable at this time.</li>\n      <li>I/We <strong>ACCEPT AND ASSUME</strong> all such risks and responsibility for losses and/or damages following such injury, disability, paralysis or death, however caused and whether caused in whole or in part by the negligence of the Releasees.</li>\n      <li>I/We <strong>HEREBY RELEASE, WAIVE, DISCHARGE AND COVENANT NOT TO SUE</strong> the martial arts facility, its owners, managers, promoters, lessees, inspectors, underwriters, consultants, directors, officers, agents and employees (\"Releasees\") from all liability for any and all claims, demands, losses or damages — including death or property damage — arising out of or relating to participation, caused in whole or in part by negligence of the Releasees or otherwise.</li>\n      <li>I/We acknowledge that <strong>THE ACTIVITIES ARE VERY DANGEROUS</strong> and involve the risk of serious injury and/or death and/or property damage. <strong>INJURIES RECEIVED MAY BE COMPOUNDED OR INCREASED BY NEGLIGENT RESCUE OPERATIONS OR PROCEDURES OF THE RELEASEES.</strong></li>\n      <li>This release is intended to be as broad and inclusive as permitted by the law of the Province or State in which the event is conducted. If any portion is held invalid, the balance shall continue in full legal force and effect.</li>\n      <li>If, despite this release, the participant makes a claim against any Releasee, the parent(s) and/or legal guardian(s) will <strong>reimburse the Releasee</strong> for any money paid to the participant on his/her behalf and hold them harmless.</li>\n    </ol>\n    <p style=\"margin-top:14px;font-weight:700;color:#111\">I HAVE READ THIS RELEASE AND WAIVER OF LIABILITY, ASSUMPTION OF RISK AND INDEMNITY AGREEMENT, FULLY UNDERSTAND ITS TERMS, UNDERSTAND THAT I HAVE GIVEN UP SUBSTANTIAL RIGHTS BY SIGNING IT, AND HAVE SIGNED IT FREELY AND VOLUNTARILY WITHOUT ANY INDUCEMENT, ASSURANCE, OR GUARANTEE BEING MADE TO ME AND INTEND MY SIGNATURE TO BE A COMPLETE AND UNCONDITIONAL RELEASE OF ALL LIABILITY TO THE GREATEST EXTENT ALLOWED BY LAW.</p>\n    <p style=\"font-size:13px;color:#444;margin-top:10px\">I hereby release <strong>Systema Floyd, Systema Cheer/Dance &amp; Floyd Karate Institute, INC.</strong> for any breach of legal duty, including but not limited to the breach of the duty of reasonable care.</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- SECTION 4: POLICIES + INITIALS -->\n  <div class=\"sf-head\" style=\"margin-top:24px\">Policies &amp; Agreements</div>\n  <div class=\"sf-scroll\">\n\n    <div class=\"sf-p\">\n      <div class=\"sf-pl\">Cancellation / Refund Policy</div>\n      <div class=\"sf-pt\">Our classrooms hold limited seating and many events/classes sell out. Please cancel at least <strong>7 days</strong> before your scheduled event/class by calling <strong>(561) 785-8480</strong> between 9am–5pm. We do not offer refunds; however, with 7 days notice we will credit your payment toward another event/class. Less than 7 days notice forfeits any payments made.</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"sf-p\">\n      <div class=\"sf-pl\">Card-on-File Policy</div>\n      <div class=\"sf-pt\">By signing this waiver and choosing to continue class, I agree to place a card on file with Systema Floyd Martial Arts. This card will be charged monthly unless prior notice of cancellation is given (see Cancellation/Refund Policy). If payment is declined, participation is suspended until payment is made and a new method is added on file. You will receive <strong>7 days notice</strong> before any pricing changes are charged to your account.</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"sf-p\">\n      <div class=\"sf-pl\">Trial Class Policy</div>\n      <div class=\"sf-pt\">The <strong>first class is free</strong>. If I choose to continue and register as a student, I will abide by the Card-on-File and Cancellation/Refund policies. If I participate in a 2nd class before registering, I will be charged a one-time mat fee. If I then register for month-to-month classes, the mat fee will be deducted from the monthly class cost.</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"sf-p\">\n      <div class=\"sf-pl\">Prorated Class Policy</div>\n      <div class=\"sf-pt\">If I register in the middle of the month or during a month where classes may be cancelled due to holidays, the cost may be <strong>prorated</strong> at the discretion of the vendor.</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"sf-p\">\n      <div class=\"sf-pl\">Photography Authorization &amp; Release</div>\n      <div class=\"sf-pt\">I hereby give SYSTEMA FLOYD, and their representatives, assigns, employees, and any person or entity acting under their permission, the right and permission to publish, reproduce, distribute, and/or otherwise use my name or my minor child's name, and any photographic image of me or my minor child, in whole or in part, as they determine in their sole discretion, without further compensation or authorization. I disclaim any interest in the photograph and acknowledge it shall constitute the sole property of the Producers.</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"sf-p\">\n      <div class=\"sf-pl\">Field Trip Release</div>\n      <div class=\"sf-pt\">I verify that I will allow my child(ren) to participate in activities involving riding in the van to and from said activity. Children will be buckled in at all times while the van is moving, and will remain sitting upright and facing forward at all times. By initialing, I confirm I understand the risks involved and allow my child to participate in said activities.</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"sf-p\" style=\"margin-bottom:0\">\n      <div class=\"sf-pl\">Credit Card Authorization</div>\n      <div class=\"sf-pt\">By signing this form, the cardholder authorizes Systema Floyd &amp; Floyd Karate Institute, INC. to charge the credit card provided for all agreed upon purchases and fees. The cardholder understands and acknowledges that their payment information will be securely saved on file for future transactions in accordance with the Card-on-File Policy above.</div>\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"border:1px solid #ddd;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 8px 8px;padding:20px;background:#fff;margin-bottom:0\">\n    <div class=\"sf-init\">\n      <p><strong>By entering your initials below, you are accepting and agreeing to all 7 policies listed above.</strong><br>\n      Your initials serve as your acknowledgment that you have read, fully understand, and consent to each policy.</p>\n      <p style=\"font-size:12px;color:#2643ff;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:0\">↓ Enter your initials in the field below ↓</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n</div>",
